nter and winner of two medals earlier in the Games, was unable to follow the pace, and lost nearly a second with her time of 1:54.97. She would hold on to silver, with the final medalist coming from the final pair, in which Jennifer Rodriguez held off former ice hockey player " [:a {:href "/athletes/100967"} "Cindy Klassen"] "."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button473900", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button473900').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Pair"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Time"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "300 m"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "700 m"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "1100 m"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "17I"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/99411"} "Anni Friesinger"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GER"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GER.png"}] "GER"]] [:td {} "1:54.02"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "25.14"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "53.48"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "1:22.83"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "label label-default"} [:abbrev {:title "World Record"} "WR"]]] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "19I"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/99389"} "Sabine Völker"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GER"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GER.png"}] "GER"]] [:td {} "1:54.97"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "24.81"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "52.98"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "1:22.93"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style "